What this licence covers

The MIT licence above covers the source code of the Claude Timeline and the
material made for it: the programs, the games, the shared engine, the
residents and their profiles, and the AI-generated artwork.

It does not cover third-party material bundled to recreate the old computers.
That stays with its owners and is included only for this personal recreation:
the Windows wallpapers (Bliss and the others), the Windows and MSN Messenger
sounds, icons and start-up art, and any other trademarks or artwork of
Microsoft or other companies. Nor does it cover anything in Local Storage,
which is not part of this repository.
